Alt. 2-5: Reuse the configuration of pathloss RS in Rel-17. The UE only transmits SRS resources in a SRS resource set associated with pathloss RS that can be accurately measured.
FFS: whether/how to define validity criteria of OLPC and UE fallback behavior if validity criteria fail.
Alt. 2-6: Reuse the configuration of pathloss RS in Rel-17;
A cell-agnostic DL RS can be the pathloss RS in the validity area and the cell-agnostic DL RS itself.

